#
# Short fragment. The rest of the defconfig is the vendor Orange Pi Zero 3W /
# sun60iw2 defconfig: configs/sun60iw2p1_t736_defconfig on
# https://github.com/orangepi-xunlong/u-boot-orangepi branch v2018.05-sun60iw2
# (orangepi-build BOOTCONFIG for orangepizero3w). Do not replace that file.
# This tree does not build a new SPL or boot0.
#
# Expected Linux DTB name: sun60i-a733-orangepi-zero3w
# CONFIG_DEFAULT_DEVICE_TREE is intentionally not set here. In the vendor
# defconfig it is "sun60iw2p1-soc-system", which is U-Boot's control DT,
# not the kernel board DTB.
#
# CONFIG_PREBOOT is a U-Boot command string. ${thox_image_id} expands from
# the merged environment (env/thoxos.env.txt) at run time, not from Kconfig.

CONFIG_BOOTDELAY=1
CONFIG_USE_PREBOOT=y
CONFIG_PREBOOT="echo THOXOS ${thox_image_id}"
